## 🟡 MEDIUM — Missing negative / edge-case tests

These are **absent tests** that allow production bugs to ship undetected:

| Missing test | Why it matters |
|---|---|
| `UpdatePrice` with non-existent SKU | Should throw `KeyNotFoundException` — untested |
| `GetProduct` with non-existent SKU | Should return `null` — untested |
| `ImportFromCsv` with malformed input | Will throw `IndexOutOfRangeException` or `FormatException` — no error handling and no test |
| `ApplyBulkDiscount` with fraction ≥ 1 | Prices go to zero or negative — no guard, no test |
| `ExportToCsv` with commas/newlines in product names | CSV injection / corruption — no escaping, no test |

